wind and armies [of angels] you did not see. And ever is Allāh, of what you do, Seeing.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"33:10","t":"[Remember] when they came at you from above you and from below you, and when eyes shifted [in fear], and hearts reached the throats, and you assumed about Allāh [various] assumptions.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"33:11","t":"There the believers were tested and shaken with a severe shaking.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"33:12","t":"And [remember] when the hypocrites and those in whose hearts is disease said, \"Allāh and His Messenger did not promise us except delusion,\"","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"33:13","t":"And when a faction of them said, \"O people of Yathrib, there is no stability for you [here], so return [home].\" And a party of them asked permission of the Prophet, saying, \"Indeed, our houses are exposed [i.e., unprotected],\" while they were not exposed. They did not intend except to flee.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"33:14","t":"And if they had been entered upon from all its [surrounding] regions and fitnah [i.e., disbelief] had been demanded of them, they would have done it and not hesitated over it except briefly.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"33:15","t":"And they had already promised Allāh before not to turn their backs [i.e., flee]. And ever is the promise to Allāh [that about which one will be] questioned.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":15,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":42,"surahs":[33],"sajdah":false}